{title: Sweet Peace, the Gift of God's Love}
{artist: Peter Bilhorn}
{key: G}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 84}

Verse 1
There [G]comes to my heart one [C]sweet [G]strain, a glad and a joyous re[D]frain;
I [G]sing it again and a[C]gain: sweet [G]peace, the [D]gift of [G]God's love.

Chorus
[G]Peace, peace, sweet [C]peace! [G]Wonderful [A]gift from a[D]bove!
O [G]wonderful, [D]wonderful [G]peace — sweet [C]peace, the [G]gift of [D]God's [G]love!
